fixture jump_coyote_frame7
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump: "Coyote time 6 f" (one frame later is an air jump)
room test/cliff
spawn 940 320
frames 40
input
  # The body walks off on frame 5 (pinned below); frame 12 is 7 frames later.
  0..5 R
  12 jump
end
expect
  at 4 state=ground
  at 5 state=air air_frames=0
  at 12 event.air_jump=1 air_jumps=0 vy=-3264
end
